#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0401 expect=noViolation domain=BW
#note "Written FIRST in runbook W2a (PLAN-operation-replacements phase 0), on the pre-change engine, to pin the arithmetic the rule ships with: --RPDY = date(--DTC) - date(earliest SJSTDTC within the subject's RPHASE), with NO RPRFDY offset (owner ruling EC-47 = (C), 2026-09-29: the offset is dropped, the rule is Partially Executable). SJ declares two stages in RPHASE P1 (earliest SJSTDTC 2020-01-01); BWDTC 2020-01-15 gives 14, which BWRPDY carries -> silent. Two stages on purpose: a noViolation verdict is immune to the Match_Datasets (USUBJID, RPHASE) join multiplying the BW record once per stage, and the earliest-stage anchor is pinned (the later stage, 2020-01-11, would give 4)."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-2
dataset BW class=FINDINGS label="Body Weight"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col BWSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col RPHASE  type=Char label="Repro Phase"
col BWDTC   type=Char label="Date/Time of Collection"
col BWRPDY  type=Num  label="Repro Phase Day of Collection"
---
S1 | BW | 001 | 1 | P1 | 2020-01-15 | 14
---

dataset SJ class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Subject Repro Stages"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SJSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col RPHASE  type=Char label="Repro Phase"
col RSTAGE  type=Char label="Repro Stage"
col SJSTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Repro Stage"
col SJENDTC type=Char label="End Date/Time of Repro Stage"
---
S1 | SJ | 001 | 1 | P1 | STAGE1 | 2020-01-01 | 2020-01-10
S1 | SJ | 001 | 2 | P1 | STAGE2 | 2020-01-11 | 2020-01-20
---
